{
  "schema": 1,
  "source": "scribe-word-timing-phrase-locked",
  "text": "An army of vanaras was building Ram Setu, boulder by boulder.\n\nAt the edge of the shore, a tiny squirrel carried one pebble at a time.\n\nThe others laughed. What difference could something so small make?\n\nBut Rama saw what they missed.\n\nThe squirrel kept showing up, whether the tide was calm or rough. And with every return, another gap was filled.\n\nInvesting can work the same way. You do not need to predict the perfect market moment. A SIP lets you invest the same amount regularly, through the ups and downs.\n\nSmall steps, repeated consistently, can build something bigger.\n\nStart your SIP with Zepp Pay.",
  "word_count": 106,
  "fps": 30,
